        "en": "Dog owners across Brooklyn praise head trainer Robert Haussmann and instructor Jenny Lee for their deep grasp of canine psychology, methodical approach, and clear guidance. Reviewers appreciate that sessions educate both dogs and human handlers with patience and positivity."
      }
