      "title": {
        "en": "Supportive positive reinforcement methods"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers emphasize the team's gentle, force-free training techniques, tailored especially for anxious, reactive, or easily overwhelmed dogs. Trainers adapt drills to each dog's comfort zone, ensuring safe distances around other animals during group park classes."
      }
    }
